# 本示例不会被 Server 自动读取。Release 安装后可在 MCP 内配置连接，或运行 install.py --configure 持久保存到 Codex；真实值不得提交到版本控制。
NEBULA_ADDRESSES=HOST:9669
NEBULA_USERNAME=USER
NEBULA_PASSWORD=PASSWORD
# 可选：连接后自动 USE 的图空间。
NEBULA_DEFAULT_SPACE=
NEBULA_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS=5000
NEBULA_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=60000
NEBULA_TLS_ENABLED=false
# 设置后校验 graphd 证书；未设置时 TLS 只加密、不校验证书。
NEBULA_TLS_CA_FILE=
# 默认只读；只有显式改为 true 后，mutation 工具才可能执行写入。
NEBULA_ALLOW_MUTATIONS=false
NEBULA_MAX_ROWS=100
NEBULA_MAX_NODES=500
NEBULA_MAX_EDGES=1000
NEBULA_MAX_BYTES=1048576
NEBULA_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Optional named environments, configured in the MCP host environment editor.
# Each environment is independent; all nested values must be strings.
# NEBULA_ENVIRONMENTS={"dev":{"NEBULA_ADDRESSES":"HOST:9669","NEBULA_USERNAME":"USER","NEBULA_PASSWORD":"PASSWORD"}}
# NEBULA_ENVIRONMENT=dev
